y+1)^{2}-2 & =x \\\\ 2(y+1)^{2} & =x+2 \\\\ (y+1)^{2} & =\\frac{1}{2}(x+2) \\\\ (y+1)^{2} & =4(\\frac{1}{8})(x+2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the vertex are $(h,k)=(-2,-1).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-103677/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "393cdd18-ede6-5870-94ad-a093e67db2fd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-103677"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-103680/selection/fdf7300d5aadacb7d5c81d6793a6b6f3166a11b8b40ea1a392b00d3f084daeef" :answer/id #uuid "c4cc3348-e8a7-578f-9c99-7f574aae5704" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-1,5)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103680/selection/8654e72713e16b156f8fb9c481fcd62f2846d20005580f67c697c7bb2c0055cd" :answer/id #uuid "91231e91-0936-5b84-a8b9-985e37800f1f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(5,2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103680/selection/f1c72963f33c0862d48b8a0d3db37a9a15f0086f42a830087c9caa8a9b6c8a48" :answer/id #uuid "775b457a-1df4-582a-8811-7c15cebc4fe8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(2,-2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103680/selection/f2b3d4b1886cc4c3079a0c9268e27d63493239a5d6ef9ca8c4a6ace4d05e3e97" :answer/id #uuid "af6b543a-8dc7-58a8-9216-93b2e858be1c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-1,4)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103680/selection/45204ae0c76cd23d55c6fc0e092c448b5bd8159be1c575530b4166fe31d349c5" :answer/id #uuid "bb35157a-3463-552b-8444-e4bd893c63b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(5,-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103680/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "03575426-8434-5ac2-b0fc-44ab13f2e455" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-103680/selection/8654e72713e16b156f8fb9c481fcd62f2846d20005580f67c697c7bb2c0055cd" :answer-field/choices ["q-103680/selection/fdf7300d5aadacb7d5c81d6793